{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Flow step debugger P3: debug_set_breakpoints(session, list) replaces a debug session's breakpoints. Entries: {kind: op|wire|sync, index, frame?, case?} stops BEFORE that item is picked (op = before its eval/enter, wire = before delivery); {kind: case, case, frame?} stops right after the case is entered (seed); {kind: rule, rule?, op?, case?, frame?} stops after the eval that fired a rule, before its effect. frame = path [[op, iter], ...] ([] = root; absent = any). Stall and error always stop. Applies to over/out/run_to/continue, replayed and executed steps alike; a run never stops on the breakpoint it starts from. Returns {status, session, breakpoints}. Admin-only.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;","params":[{"name":"session","type":"String"},{"name":"list","type":"JSONArray"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"lyxgmp1a16a4698d4x9d","readers":[],"time":1792784381114,"username":"system","writers":[]}